
<div class="window">
  <div class="bar"><span class="dot r"></span><span class="dot y"></span><span class="dot g"></span><span class="title">terminal — contributor-quickstart</span></div>
  <pre><code><span class="c"># 1. Clone & set up multi-repo Go workspace</span>
<span class="p">$ </span><span class="k">git</span> clone https://github.com/krewire/framework.git
<span class="p">$ </span><span class="k">cd</span> framework && <span class="k">go</span> work sync

<span class="c"># 2. Run the 3 Krewire Quality Gates</span>
<span class="p">$ </span><span class="k">go</span> fmt ./...
<span class="p">$ </span><span class="k">go</span> vet ./...
<span class="p">$ </span><span class="k">go</span> test -race ./...

<span class="c"># 3. Build & Dogfood the site workload</span>
<span class="p">$ </span><span class="k">kiw</span> build
<span class="t">✓ 100% test coverage · Spec-Driven Development verified</span></code></pre>
</div>

